<!--
    SM-A300FU: stock A300FUXXU1CSG3 CamcorderProfiles (also present in Android 5).
    Both cameras support 1920x1080/30. Keep other msm8916 codec capabilities;
    CIF and VGA are additional standard qualities backed by the native HAL.
    High-speed sensor profiles require separate validation.
-->
